ei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          Amarelo)\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          海拔：1200 米\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           批次：\n           <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n            Lot 2023 Confluência\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           地块：BV149\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          处理方式：厌氧日晒60小时 Anaerobic Natural 60 Hours\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(217, 33, 66);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          风味：菇娘果、橙子、绿葡萄\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(217, 33, 66);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Golden berry, Orange, Green grape\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这款黄瑰夏，虽然处理方式是60小时的厌氧发酵，但与贝图里亚的黄瑰夏相比发酵感会弱很多，整体还是偏柑橘一些的小酸甜，容易喝～\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          品种：黄阿拉莫莎\n          <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           Jacira\n          </span>\n          Yellow Aramosa (\n          <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           Jacira)\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          海拔：1200 米\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          批次：\n          <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n           Lot 1987 Reencontro\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n<span style='font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n            地块：BV149\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理方式：厌氧日晒72小时 Anaerobic Natural 72 Hours\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n         风味：\n         <span style=\"color: rgb(217, 33, 66);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          花香、柑橘、菇娘果、蓝莓\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(217, 33, 66);font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          Floral, Citrus, Golden berry, Blue berry\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(217, 33, 66);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(217, 33, 66);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          这款黄Aramosa在刚烘焙后一周内喝就感觉喝不到什么有辨识度的风味，觉得它怎么喝都是那种甜坚果的调调，放了两周后再喝突然发现，哎哟，有淡淡的花香和花茶的感觉，还有橘子和菇娘果复合一起的香气，酸甜感是偏柑橘类的很柔顺，尾韵会像是蓝莓的甜感和果香，整体很“柔软”～\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;max-width: 100%;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;color: rgb(217, 33, 66);font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q36MicNiclTfcCUkjP6ZaWC6TuSBFdG4b00oOkHd97wB6V2VlSqkrnIaCSyJ16FV2GkicZCPWzhfT7w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"height: 840px;width: 578px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7TYSibVOfDRbicMRo8QHasfia2JzibF9IAJkZArPVRvl2Uy0c2oHicbFfzSKYiaySSKPXbYejibWDvTdxQDg/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"text-align: center;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          图片来自cafeimports 棕榈树位于米纳斯州喜拉多区域，橘黄色区块\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          关于豆种介绍\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            豆种信息\n            <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n             Jacira\n            </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Jacira不是咖啡市场上发布的官方栽培品种，而是在达特拉庄园与IAC研究\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           所(InstitutoAgronômicodeCampinas)的合作研究领域中筛选出的特定遗传豆\n          </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\">\n           种。\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           在对不同类型豆种的杂交和遗传进行了多年试验的同时，达特拉庄园的研究\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           领域充满了不同寻常和令人惊喜的咖啡豆种。\n          </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Jacira是一个非常特殊的选择，它有着阿拉莫莎的血统。阿拉莫莎豆种是阿\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           拉比卡咖啡和莫桑比克咖啡的混种。达特拉庄园在20多年前就开始了对阿拉莫\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           莎豆种的研究，庄园在管理阿拉莫莎种植区时，有了奇怪而惊人的发现：有一棵\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           长着黄色果实的咖啡树。这也许是因为自然杂交，或者甚至是因为基因突变。于\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           是达特拉庄园开始种植了这种新咖啡树，在第一年就收获了咖啡鲜果。\n          </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Jacira正是达特拉庄园为这个黄色的阿拉莫莎豆种取定的名字。\n          </span>\n</p>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<strong style=\"font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            关于达特拉 Daterra\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           1902年，一个来自意大利的家庭跳上了一艘开往巴西的船，开启了新生活的探险，最终来到了Campinas市落脚并种植咖啡来生活；1908年，家里较为年长的儿子在集市上开了一个咖啡摊，售卖咖啡豆并教导家庭主妇们如何烘烤咖啡，这是这个家族最早与咖啡结缘的经历。\n          </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           随后，小伙子娶了当地的一个女孩子组织了家庭，为了家庭生计和更好的生活，他们转型美食店、加油站，但夫妇两都较早的离世，家里的重担就落在了长子Donato身上，在很迷茫无助的时候，出现了一位Donato完全不认识的陌生人，提供了资助使得生活和生意得以维持，这个陌生人只说他认识他的父母，后代们回忆这段“传说”往事时，都觉得这就是家族认定的“信念、希望、团结、对人以尊重”的价值观的来源。\n          </span>\n</p>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SiaibPk55zUw46qOkcAY9gUL3HGGKMadEzZQE9yv22ichq8xHCe5fOSicbe8Gm5lXhCjKO4jqibNXW1Ag/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          一直到1976年，经历了多年的变革，家族才重新开启农业的投入，创立了达特拉庄园，Daterra的意思是“来自地球”，随后尝试了养牛、种植牛油果，然后再过渡到咖啡的种植。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          （中间的历程可以看下面的回忆录了解）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            庄园回忆录\n           </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           在80年代后半期，路易斯(Luis)和里奥(Leo)聘请顾问进行了一项大规模的\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           研究，顾问推荐了可种植的农产品，他们对其进行了投资。咖啡因种植过程太复\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           杂，在当时从未被列入计划，但在这些研究中，咖啡已经展现出可种植的潜力。\n          </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           1987年，为了生产牛奶，路易斯和里奥在圣保罗州的弗兰卡(Franca,São\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           Paulo)买了一个农场。最初，他们计划研究生产牛奶。但因为农场已经有了几公\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           顷的阿拉比卡咖啡种植园，使得他们对咖啡种植产生了兴趣。\n          </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\">\n           他们意识到咖啡似\n          </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.034em;font-size: 14px;\">\n           乎是实现梦想的完美载体，这是非常有趣的发现。咖啡的\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           种植需要广泛的研究，并进行实验；此外，这也是实践“借土还土”理念的最佳方\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           式。\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           此后，世界上出现了一种叫做“精品咖啡”的浪潮，它让达特拉庄园脱离大宗\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n           商品市场，生产出高品质的精品咖啡。\n          </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          如今，达特拉有3个农场，分别是 Boa Vista、Taboues 和Franca，达特拉将种植地块细分为 1-5 公顷的区域为一个区块，每个区块委派一个专人的农艺师照\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          料，庄园开发\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          了精细的管理系统与设备，配合卫星定位管理，实时监控降雨量、温度等详细数\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          据，整个庄园共\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          有42位农艺师照顾着216个种植区块。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SiaibPk55zUw46qOkcAY9gULFjib7icibIEeklAjib0B5okK2HzGM4s3fWuEac1YV28ibR6VmibSu5foarsA/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SiaibPk55zUw46qOkcAY9gULFRsAticCf3vfgZEzVc6zl0hZib73WVLNTCib47hAibdiamtsRMVWs3hOHEQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          达特拉的咖啡分为3个系列，分别是\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SiaibPk55zUw46qOkcAY9gULBYIDPjXVR1EIwiaZaVibgDI5zRbDdoKH6P76sKEfUYslcWwSS3oXTtXA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Classic - 达特拉 经典\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          达特拉的经典是“喜拉多”，这种全球很早就驰名的咖啡品类、品名的代表，在达特拉，单一品种或者是混合批次，由庄园的杯测师评分在80-86分的咖啡会被纳入Classic这一产品。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Collection - 达特拉 甄选\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          甄选洗礼，是达特拉的当前的精细的种植、加工处理的体现，它是达特拉每一产季豆单上庄园最“拿手”的产品，完全可追溯到品种、地块和所有的处理过程，评分在86-89分之间。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           Masterpiece - 达特拉 杰作\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          没有翻译成大师，是因为它不仅仅是代表了庄园那些杰出的农艺师、杯测师们的努力和卓越，它更体现的是庄园所种植的这些咖啡品种的优异，所以是咖啡豆与人都极佳的表现和配合下最终才得以有这一系列的产品。Masterpiece的每一个产品都是一个独有的创新尝试，在每一产季在达特拉都是独一无二的微批次，完全可追索所有的信息，评分在88分以上。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SiaibPk55zUw46qOkcAY9gULB1ubeAHsvZmJibApqsWiatroic4kNIYT2RSe9MZmcZlmqkdm5OUicXgojQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SiaibPk55zUw46qOkcAY9gULA8Z9ricjDWHrL2icVQskeftkvWc24yxPZTibeHlk7Q7bTsIBeic1nYC0IA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          基于在汽车制造业的一些技术经验积累，达特拉的工程师们革新改进了加工处理的设备，水洗处理的设备可以根据咖啡果的不同成熟度来调节脱皮用的水压，而日晒处理的浮选设备可以根据咖啡果的密度以及大小来精细的筛选不同成熟度、颗粒大小的鲜果。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
